---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'October 11, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Service — ${SITE.fullName}`}
  description="Reelay Studio Terms of Service. Desktop software license, creator data ownership, third-party platform API compliance, and fair local-first terms."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <div class="badge badge-brand">Software Agreement</div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last Updated: {lastUpdated} • Version 1.2</p>
      </header>

      <div class="compliance-box">
        <h3 class="compliance-box-title">Key Principle: Complete Creator Ownership</h3>
        <p>
          You own 100% of your video footage, scripts, captions, and creative assets. Reelay is a local desktop utility tool designed to help you organize and publish your media. We claim zero rights, copyright, or ownership over anything you create or process within Reelay Studio.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By downloading, installing, or running the Reelay Studio desktop application ("Software") or accessing the Reelay website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, do not install or use the Software.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Software License & Local-First Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Subject to these Terms, Reelay grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install and execute the Software on compatible desktop devices (macOS and Windows) that you own or control.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Local Execution:</strong> The Software executes locally on your workstation. Core features—such as video playback, offline Whisper AI transcription, and SQLite database storage—do not require cloud server connectivity.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Telemetry Lock-In:</strong> We do not hold your project data hostage behind cloud subscriptions. Your SQLite database file and media assets remain on your machine at all times.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Platform Terms & API Compliance</h2>
        <p>
          Reelay Studio provides optional integrations with third-party social media platforms via their developer APIs. When connecting external accounts, you agree to comply with the respective platform terms:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>YouTube:</strong> By connecting your YouTube account, you agree to be bound by the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube Terms of Service</a> and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Meta (Facebook, Instagram, Threads):</strong> You agree to comply with Meta's Commercial Terms, Platform Terms, and Developer Policies.</li>
          <li><strong>TikTok:</strong> You agree to comply with the TikTok Terms of Service and Developer Terms.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Reelay Studio acts purely as a local client software facilitating communication directly between your workstation and these authorized APIs. Reelay is not responsible for any enforcement actions, account limitations, or rate limits imposed on your account by third-party platforms.
        </p>

        <h2>4. User Responsibilities & Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>When using Reelay Studio, you agree that you will not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Software to download or repost copyrighted video content without proper authorization or rights from the content creator.</li>
          <li>Violate any applicable local, national, or international laws or regulations.</li>
          <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, decompile, or bypass the Software's <code>ScopedPipeline</code> safety approval mechanisms to execute unauthorized automated actions.</li>
          <li>Use automated rules or bot engines to flood or abuse third-party platform rate limits or spread malicious spam.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Artificial Intelligence (AI) Integrations & Bring-Your-Own-Key</h2>
        <p>
          Reelay Studio provides integration endpoints for the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and third-party large language models (such as Claude, ChatGPT, and Gemini).
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Direct Provider Relationship:</strong> You bring your own API keys or AI assistant client subscriptions. Your usage of those AI services is governed directly by your agreement with the respective AI provider.</li>
          <li><strong>No Token Markup:</strong> Reelay Studio does not resell, mark up, or middle-man LLM tokens.</li>
          <li><strong>Human-in-the-Loop Safeguards:</strong> Reelay includes durable approval queues for all destructive actions. You acknowledge that you remain solely responsible for reviewing and verifying AI-generated copy, tags, or publishing commands prior to authorizing execution.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Data Backups & Media Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Because Reelay Studio operates as a local-first application without centralized cloud backups:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>You are solely responsible for maintaining backups of your raw video footage, local SQLite database, and media folders.</li>
          <li>Reelay Studio is not liable for data loss resulting from hardware failure, operating system corruption, or accidental local file deletion.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. REELAY DOES NOT WARRANT THAT THE SOFTWARE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF THIRD-PARTY API COMPATIBILITY DISRUPTIONS.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL REELAY STUDIO, ITS CONTRIBUTORS, OR ITS AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES (INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, USE, GOODWILL, OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Modifications to the Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. When updates occur, we will update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this document. Continued use of the Software after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service or commercial licensing inquiries, please contact:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Reelay Legal Desk:</strong> <code>compliance@reelay.app</code><br />
          <strong>Developer Support:</strong> <code>support@reelay.app</code>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .compliance-box-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--brand-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
